1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:04,373
(Sheldon:)So, yes, I'll go to your dopey play.

2
00:00:05,951 --> 00:00:08,821
- Hey, I don't want you to go anymore.
- Why not?

3
00:00:08,988 --> 00:00:11,248
Go because you want to,
not because you have to.

4
00:00:11,457 --> 00:00:14,327
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord, more rules.
Where does it stop?

5
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:19,990
(Sheldon:)Can I want to go
because I have to want to go?

6
00:00:20,266 --> 00:00:23,396
- Okay, do whatever you want.
- Yeah, but, no, wait.

7
00:00:23,569 --> 00:00:27,869
(Sheldon:)Do whatever I want
or whatever I have to want?

8
00:00:29,275 --> 00:00:31,535
(Penny:)Oh, for God's sake, just come to the play.

9
00:00:31,711 --> 00:00:32,841
(Sheldon:)All right.

10
00:00:33,012 --> 00:00:35,172
(Sheldon:)I don't want to
but at least that makes sense.

11
00:00:42,088 --> 00:00:45,718
(Sheldon:)You know, I haven't seen Raj
in several days.

12
00:00:45,891 --> 00:00:48,361
(Sheldon:)Is he no longer a part of our social group?

13
00:00:48,728 --> 00:00:51,718
(Sheldon:)And if so, should we be
interviewing for a replacement?

14
00:00:53,499 --> 00:00:59,019
(Sheldon:)Perhaps this time we go Latin.

